uild and begins martial arts training with chief instructor Brod. As part of that training, he is forced to drink Substance X, a mysterious and disgusting beverage that confers special powers like a cheat item.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-07-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m1kuOEzJGph6Yy9BKHYGN2OGPo6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m1kuOEzJGph6Yy9BKHYGN2OGPo6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/220779/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"4567060","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Luciel gets a break from training to learn about butchering monsters with Gulgar's brother, Galba, and study world history and culture with Nanaella. While shopping with Nanaella one day, he discovers Monika unconscious and bleeding on the street.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-08-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yhbI9BY54k6ivQojoKyVfbCMcc7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yhbI9BY54k6ivQojoKyVfbCMcc7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/220779/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"4579244","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"It's been a year and Luciel needs to renew his registration at the Healer's Guild. What rank will he be? Luciel jumps into the next level of his training, when he encounters the Healer who left Monika to die...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-08-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2J7wwfoZvV0oaNUlNRz9uBCUt5n.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2J7wwfoZvV0oaNUlNRz9uBCUt5n.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://w